  "usage_note": "**Egg** alone usually means a chicken's egg; other kinds are named: *a duck egg*, *quail eggs*. A whole egg is countable (*an egg*, *two eggs*); egg as a substance is uncountable (*egg on your shirt*, *too much egg in the cake*).",
